# ============================================================
#
#   def __init__() -> None
#     Summary: Initialize the ScarabDrum with default parameters.
#     Details:
#     Sets up the four-sphere coordinate system, initializes the beat counter,
#     and prepares the internal state dictionary. The drum starts in 'standard'
#     mode with tempo 120 BPM.
#
#     Preconditions:
#       - Instance must be properly initialized
#
