#       - Return value conforms to documented type
#       - Internal state is consistent
#       - No side effects beyond documented behavior
#
#     Exceptions:
#       - TypeError: Invalid parameter type
#       - ValueError: Parameter out of valid range
#
#     Thread Safety: Read-safe, write-exclusive
#     Complexity: O(n) average case
#
#   def beat(tempo: int = 120) -> dict
#     Summary: Generate one rhythmic beat.
#     Details:
#     Computes sphere positions at the given tempo, applies chromatic offsets,
#     and returns a dictionary containing position data, velocity vectors, and
#     timing information. Uses prime-number offsets for non-repeating patterns.
#
#     Preconditions:
#       - Instance must be properly initialized
#
#     Postconditions:
#       - Return value conforms to documented type
#       - Internal state is consistent
#       - No side effects beyond documented behavior
